    "image": "https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1567/415/villages_update_thumbnail-jpg.jpg",
    "tags": ["mobs", "villagers", "aldeao", "rpg"],
    "short": "Core Craft transforms Minecraft into a richer survival-RPG experience packed with new adventures, creatures, and ways to play.",
    "description": "Core Craft transforms Minecraft into a richer survival-RPG experience packed with new adventures, creatures, and ways to play. Explore a world full of quests, structures, unique mobs, and immersive systems designed to make your gameplay deeper and more rewarding.\nKey Features\nQuest System – Meet the Quest Master, collect tasks, and track your progress with the Quest Book. Earn rewards by completing objectives or restart quests for a new challenge.\nNew Mobs – Encounter fresh wildlife, dangerous monsters, and even mystical beings like mermaids and sirens.\nExpanded Survival – Grow new crops, cook fresh recipes, and discover unique farming and cooking mechanics.\nWorld Variety – Decorate your home with furniture, explore lush foliage, and collect rare resources such as Ruby.\nBuilt-in Guidebook – Use the Core Craft Wiki Book to learn about every new feature without leaving the game.\nStep into Core Craft and give your Minecraft world new life with quests, creatures, and creative possibilities!",
    "downloadUrl": "https://1024terabox.com/s/1SYxQEsXkB6x9-fRcw9Pmaw",
    "author": "By CoreCraft",
    "youtubeId": "g3CBnn_ptHw"
  },
